# TEAM.md is the one file several people append to at once (the pod's name and
# size, then a roster line each). `merge=union` keeps every line from both
# sides instead of raising a conflict nobody in a breakout should have to
# resolve.
#
# ready/ and team/ and spec/ deliberately get NO union rule: one file per
# person means two people never write the same file, so there is nothing to
# union and a conflict there would be a real one worth stopping for.
TEAM.md merge=union
